{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/171587-pentex-subsidiaries","id":171587,"title":"Pentex Subsidiaries","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-17T06:16:24-07:00","id":171587,"title":"Pentex Subsidiaries","content":"So I was reviewing BotW20, and looking at older material like &quot;Subsidiaries: A Guide to Pentex&quot;, and thinking about other possible Subsidiaries worth exploring (or existent Subsidiaries worth expanding/updating).<br /> <br /> TruCall Holdings: Cable and Internet provider, that grew out of telephone service provider (hence the name); known for exploitative practices toward consumers that it can get away with thanks to the oligopolistic set up of the market. In addition it is instrumental in shaping access to information for its consumers and thus is heavily involved in Pentex's Public Relations for it and its Subsidiaries. It is through TruCall that Pentex owns its several television networks...<br /> <br /> -Omni TV: increasingly dominated by exploitative reality television (&quot;Who Wants to Marry a [insert T word I won't write]?&quot; &quot;In Jail with the Octavians!&quot; &quot;Children of Africa&quot; [about cute white hero children] &quot;Sex Stars of Wallstreet!&quot;....)<br /> -Omni Kids: mostly licenses franchise cartoons meant to push Avalon &amp; Tellus products - biggest hit is Our Friendly Bunnies, via a fanatic adult male fanbase with heavily sexualized fan-works dominating fanspaces to keep out actual children the original creators were aiming for before Avalon &amp; Omni moved in - a triumph in Avalon's quest for arrested development.<br /> -RED Network: whose pundits will always find time to rail against the filth on Omni; or in the adult film industry; so that Pentex can make money coming &amp; going<br /> -Private Playground (aka &quot;the Double-P&quot;), a major adult entertainment studio, with its own pay per view network courtesy of TruCall; prides itself in constantly pushing the edge in degredation, for which point they seek out only the truly desperate in performers, so refusal can be pushed to a non-issue. [Double-P also has less legit subsidiary studios, and based on customer viewing habits knows who to link to those webpages... and then hold via blackmail leverage of their own digital footprints]<br /> <br /> AquaTek Aventures: This is Pentex Board Nominee &quot;Mike's&quot; idea that he shared on the kickstarter comments page. Short version: it's Sea World in the front, Projects Iliad &amp; Lycaon with aquatic monstrosities in the back.<br /> <br /> Blackfire Security: Private military contractor that works closely with Nastrum. Go to mercenaries for dirty situations where Western governments and various powerful corporations don't want to use their own militaries/security-forces. Will outfit Pentex First Teams for the right price. (yes, I borrowed the name from the New World of Darkness)<br /> <br /> Eterent: An agrobusiness biotech company very close to actively wiping bees off the face of the earth with its pesticides. It has also found great legal versatility in the ability to patent dna, so that the spread of pollen from its plants allows the proprietary claiming of crops from farms that have never done business with Eterent. Its special strains of high fructose corn syrup is found in the majority of Young &amp; Smith products.<br /> <br /> CSS Health &amp; Education: Formerly &quot;Community Security Solutions&quot;, CSS Health &amp; Education is a private prison contractor. It's mandatory quotas in its contracts with the state guarantee a continuous greasing of the wheels of the incarceration industrial complex masquerading as a justice system in the US. These prisoners in turn provide cheap labor that several other Pentex subsidiaries actively utilize. Zettler has also been known to utilize the inmate population, who are already treated by their environment as little more than caged animals.<br /> <br /> GEO Dreams: an education reform company that has mastered the art of raiding teacher pensions, and the money tied to each student, pushing standardized testing built on the bedrock of the eugenics movement, and franchising some of the most truly bizarre charter school programs in the Wyrm's service you could ever dread to imagine.<br /> <br /> *Herrick's: instead of a grocery store, Herrick's should really have expanded by this point to be Pentex's WalMart.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T07:14:01-07:00","id":171629,"title":"","content":"Family Auto: creator of low cost, family friendly vehicles with an impressive life expectancy. The cars' emissions would be poor, and the vehicle wouldn't be very safe, but their low maintenance requirements means the families would keep driving them. The company would also have a huge lobby for lowering the emission regulations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3097-gator-the-unread","name":"Gator the Unread","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3097_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T08:10:38-07:00","id":171655,"title":"","content":"Ameripath: A large scheme that encourages people in need to start up tjeir own &quot;company&quot; using supplied Ameripath goods with promises of huge profits (both through their own sales, and the sales of others they get to also join the business)... but most lose the investment (often their life savings) and leave them with unfulfilled dreams and broke. Others buy and use the exclusive Amerpath products they sell, which are all toxic, child-labor-made, cheaply-made as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">- Arthur &quot;Torakhan&quot; Dreese <span style=\"color:silver\"><b>David &quot;Wall-of-Text&quot; Tealdeer</b> - US2012070036\u200b - Grand Rapids, MI</span><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img855/1250/jv8k.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nmeqe3m\" target=\"_blank\">V:tM 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/pavtnjj\" target=\"_blank\">Hunters Hunted II</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/l3hjgjt\" target=\"_blank\">Anarchs Unbound</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\">W:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\">W20 Changing Breeds</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/m64m9o5\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3rd Edition</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/qxkop7m\" target=\"_blank\">M:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\">W20BotW</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/780-torakhan","name":"Torakhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar780_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"576"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T13:01:30-07:00","id":171930,"title":"","content":"Some way to exploit the microfinance / microloan movement to spread corruption while bathing in charity donations from people who think they're helping folks in poor countries. Like Feed-and-Read, it probably is helping people in addition to spreading corruption. There must be a way, I just can't think of it...<br /> <br /> Hard-rock mining company, similar to Endron in that they target possible caerns and places where horrible monsters or Banes might be buried. Cheap child labor wherever they can get away with it, and creative ways to &quot;dispose&quot; of toxic and tainted mine tailings. In regions with troublesome Shapeshifter populations or possible buried &quot;treasure&quot; but few or no fossil fuel reserves, this is an alternative to Endron. Supplies raw materials to many of the manufacturing subsidiaries of Pentex. Supplies slightly tainted raw materials to non-Pentex companies that have no reason of their own to manufacture tainted products, or expose their employees to Wyrm taint.<br /> <br /> Manufacturer of the world's most advanced myoelectric and nerve-controlled prosthetics for people missing a limb or eye, for blind people, for deaf people. Maybe pacemakers and other medical implants. A partnership of Wyrm and Weaver technology. The prosthetics are so advanced because each contains a Bane which helps power its advanced capabilities. They especially target disabled veterans who have combat experience. Not everybody becomes a Fomor, of course, or the program would have problems... only those &quot;customers&quot; who show promise, which includes alienation from civilian society, bitterness, anger, any nightmares or negative emotions that the Bane can exploit. For them, the physical therapy and Magadon drugs are subtly designed to awaken the Bane. The resulting Fomori have enough extra limbs to make up for whichever one was missing. Others are not converted, but the Bane is carried around and drips taint wherever they go, and tries to increase their negative emotions.<br /> <br /> A predatory-lending bank sponsored by the servants of the Urge of Despair. Because a great way to make people feel helpless is to trap them in inescapable debt, especially in countries without consumer protection laws. It's also just so profitable. No need to do anything supernatural or make bad business decisions to spread dispair and political corruption.<br /> <br /> An environmental review and cleanup company. I'm not sure how exactly it would work, but basically, lots of environmental scientists who do things like environmental impact statements, environmental reviews, cleaning up toxic waste sites and poisoned areas. Most of the employees would be innocent humans dedicated to making the world better and totally ignorant about their bosses' bosses. The company would do plenty of genuinely good things for various pieces of land. But they'd also tweak environmental impact statements given to government regulators... keep an eye on which pieces of land are inhabited by which Shapeshifters or other supernaturals... When they clean up toxic waste sites, what they're often actually doing is either supernaturally disguising the taint and pollution so that it looks &quot;clean,&quot; burying it deeper (underground, or into the Near Umbra) where it won't be noticed as easily, or shipping it somewhere more strategically useful. They also fund tons of research on the environmental effects of various pollution on humans and wildlife, but part of that is testing other Pentex chemicals for effects, experimenting on unwilling subjects and on the landscape. When the honest researchers discover that a polluted site is worse off than studies from 30-50 years ago suggested, sometimes that's because the company's earlier surveyers made it worse. They also get to gather tons of intel on the other environmental organizations which work with them, install hidden outposts and footholds deep in strategic wilderness areas. They're so generous about buying up damaged land that they want to improve and save... and if they don't need it any more they make sure to sell it to somebody who won't go against Pentex interests.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":". 06-17-2014, 04:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T13:18:28-07:00","id":171941,"title":"","content":"<b>Voltaic Crafts</b> (<i>Now has shorted down to &quot;VC&quot;</i>): A video game developer, publisher, marketer, and distributor that could give Tellus a run for it's money. And is probably plotting to take over Tellus by &quot;gutting&quot; all the employees there as we speak.<br /> <br /> <b>Thoseguyswithmonocles.com</b>: A major website hosting internet reviewers who review everything under the sun and Pentex-made material. For example, the Film Braggart mostly reviews old Gorehound/Exploitation movies and is immune to the banes within them: But his viewers aren't...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1137,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","user":"Laughing Hyena","date":". 06-17-2014, 04:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T14:12:35-07:00","id":172015,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/171587-pentex-subsidiaries#post171587\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Eterent: An agrobusiness biotech company very close to actively wiping bees off the face of the earth with its pesticides. It has also found great legal versatility in the ability to patent dna, so that the spread of pollen from its plants allows the proprietary claiming of crops from farms that have never done business with Eterent. Its special strains of high fructose corn syrup is found in the majority of Young &amp; Smith products.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wiping out honeybees, and hopefully most other bee and pollinating insect species, has real benefits for the Wyrm, from imperiling wildlife to promoting famine and the poverty and violence that go with it.<br /> <br /> It's also very profitable. When natural pollination becomes impossible in some part of the world, anyone who can supply <i>artificial</i> pollination gets a lucrative monopoly on the honeybee business. (You don't even need to give up on the famine, as long as there are people too poor to afford your pollination services.)<br /> <br /> Eterent is already marketing their genetically engineered honeybees to farmers around the world. These bees are of course immune to all Eterent pesticides and unharmed by Wyrm-taint. They aggressively spread, hybridizing with (or outright killing) any remaining non-Eterent honeybees near their hives, and Eterent is busy patenting and trademarking their DNA in as many countries as possible so they can squeeze royalties (and lawsuits) out of anyone whose hive has been hybridized, or whose crops have been pollinated by Eterent bees. Their hives appear perfectly healthy even in polluted, tainted, and heavily pesticide-sprayed farms. They produce almost as much honey as killer bees with far less aggression, so they're a good alternative for farmers bothered by Africanized honey bees. They even hybridize with and &quot;tame&quot; killer bee hives they encounter. The fewer natural pollinators survive, the more profit Eterent makes from honeybees immune to the &quot;mysterious&quot; but obviously &quot;completely natural&quot; colony collapse plague.<br /> <br /> The researchers are busy designing and testing new strains of these bees. Some produce more honey or wax than the first commercialized strain. Two of the most promising efficiently convert any pesticides they consume into Wyrm taint undetectable by mundane means. One strain laces honey and wax with the Wyrm poison, to taint people who eat the honey or inhale smoke from beeswax candles. The second strain spreads the taint into the pollen they carry and feeds it back into pollinated plants, so the seeds take the taint into them at conception. The goal is for plants to grow up inherently tainted in every part of their tissue, and for fruits produced from the pollinated plants to be tainted. The bees spread it around to wild plants as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":". 06-17-2014, 05:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T17:11:19-07:00","id":172192,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/171587-pentex-subsidiaries?p=171930#post171930\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hard-rock mining company, similar to Endron in that they target possible caerns and places where horrible monsters or Banes might be buried. Cheap child labor wherever they can get away with it, and creative ways to &quot;dispose&quot; of toxic and tainted mine tailings. In regions with troublesome Shapeshifter populations or possible buried &quot;treasure&quot; but few or no fossil fuel reserves, this is an alternative to Endron. Supplies raw materials to many of the manufacturing subsidiaries of Pentex. Supplies slightly tainted raw materials to non-Pentex companies that have no reason of their own to manufacture tainted products, or expose their employees to Wyrm taint.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just to point out: Harold &amp; Harold Mining is a listed Pentex Subsidiary this can fit nicely with <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T01:07:41-07:00","id":172533,"title":"","content":"Color + Noun + (Industry) = Any one of many, many, many shell corporations set up for legal, illegal, and tax reasons. These companies can exist for as short a time as it took you to read this sentence if the wire transfer goes through fast enough.<br /> <br /> <i>Black House Logistics</i> may have folded under legal pressure, <i>but not before laundering money to Amber Horizon Medical</i>!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3197-david-michael-felt","name":"David Michael Felt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3197_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T02:56:12-07:00","id":172579,"title":"","content":"I've been thinking about it, and I think AquaTek Adventures (admittedly not my baby, but I'm speaking with regard to my own table and sharing the idea) should be owned via the Hallahan Fishing Company, including Jolly Cap'n Bill Hallahan as its park mascot, the same figure as on Hallahan products bought by consumers at Herrick's, and Hallahan's own chain of Fast/Seafood restaurants.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T22:29:01-07:00","id":175785,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/171587-pentex-subsidiaries#post171587\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> CSS Health &amp; Education: Formerly &quot;Community Security Solutions&quot;, CSS Health &amp; Education is a private prison contractor. It's mandatory quotas in its contracts with the state guarantee a continuous greasing of the wheels of the incarceration industrial complex masquerading as a justice system in the US. These prisoners in turn provide cheap labor that several other Pentex subsidiaries actively utilize. Zettler has also been known to utilize the inmate population, who are already treated by their environment as little more than caged animals.</div> </div> </div> </div>New idea on CSS's management inspired upon reading &quot;Subsidiaries: A Guide to Pentex&quot; and the diverse management of other subsidiaries...<br /> <br /> Obviously, in the WoD, vampires have a strong investment in prison privatization - it's their MacDonald's/O'Tooley's. The President of CSS is a ghoul. His master is a 6th Generation CAMARILLA Malkavian (one of the ones who gave up Dementation long ago for Dominate), Marcus Bold, who began his work supply a stable food source within the Masquerade in the slave trade, and transitioned to the Jim Crow prison industrial complex after abolition. Little does his Camarilla brethren know that Marcus's Sire is a certain 5th Generation Antitribu.<br /> <br /> Of course Zettler thinks is progeny is more loyal to him and the Omega Plan than he actually is - he assumes Marcus no more loyal to the Camarilla than he is to the Sabbat. But in truth, Marcus has come to embrace the status-quo the Camarilla represents, especially via his work in a stable food-supply. He certainly has no ideological devotion to the Wyrm. While he's willing to supply test subjects for Zettler's experiments (especially via the newly licensed immigrant detainment centers in the Southwest US and in the UK), things my come to a head soon as Pentex wants to taint the prisoners to infect feeding Vampires (ala tainting human food supplies in their other subsidiaries), and Marcus is having NONE OF THAT.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T22:31:44-07:00","id":175786,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/171587-pentex-subsidiaries?p=171930#post171930\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A predatory-lending bank sponsored by the servants of the Urge of Despair. Because a great way to make people feel helpless is to trap them in inescapable debt, especially in countries without consumer protection laws. It's also just so profitable. No need to do anything supernatural or make bad business decisions to spread dispair and political corruption.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> THANK YOU! I should have thought of that... especially since I'm dealing here in Texas with a likely next Governor who is a puppet for the Pay Day Lenders.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T00:50:28-07:00","id":175849,"title":"","content":"Tyche Fortune &amp; Entertainment, Ltd: consolidated in the Bahamas, this gaming company (as in gambling, not Tellus gaming) owns several casinos through the Caribbean, Vegas, Atlantic City, etc etc. They still operate said businesses including with less official loan sharks and bookies, but increasingly their fortune is built on online gambling with systems carefully designed for maximum addiction. In the end, the most addicted users chose to put their own soul up as collateral with the hope of winning everything back.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T00:59:37-07:00","id":175854,"title":"","content":"More networks under TruCall<br /> - RED Sports: formerly OmniSports, but the property was transfered over to the RED Network when TruCall acquired RED for Pentex. Plays to the lowest basest common denominator in fanatic sports fandom, fueling fanatic rivalries, embrace of any-means-to-win attitudes, violent machismo, and general investiture of self-identity in the success of teams that have nothing to do with the viewer. Needless to say, Kings Breweries is a MAJOR sponsor.<br /> - RED Finance: Consolidex Worldwide's mouthpiece guiding shoddy investment for their profit. There's of course tiny print disclaimers about the investment advise pundits give regarding conflicts of interest, but that does little to deter viewers in pissing away their life savings<br /> - RED Weather: Another former &quot;Omni&quot; sister channel that made the transfer over to RED. Pretty much a normal weather channel... except for the Climate Change denialism that runs through most everything aired","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T01:11:56-07:00","id":175858,"title":"","content":"In addition to individual candidate/campaign SuperPACs, I imagine Pentex has a couple of standing uber-PACs dedicated to corporate deregulation, &quot;law and order&quot; on street crime, etc etc.<br /> <br /> That and I'm sure they have a think tanks and legislature writing groups like the (real life) American Legislative Exchange Council.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T03:05:00-07:00","id":175888,"title":"","content":"Oran-Cocolive: a producer of soaps, detergents, household cleaners, and oral hygiene products. Their products contain no Wyrm-taint, and in fact work exceptionally well. So exceptionally well that they are crippling immune systems in the western world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T08:07:06-07:00","id":176006,"title":"","content":"Now that I think about it, what about a corrupt charity organization for GLS (Genetic Lycanthope Syndrome)? Of which, none of the money even goes to DNA?<br /> <br /> *Cough*, *Cough* <a href=\"http://goldenheartedrose.tumblr.com/post/89338501188/autism-speaks-masterpost-new-updated-6-20-14\" target=\"_blank\">That's even way worse than a real world counterpart</a>?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T11:54:14-07:00","id":176253,"title":"","content":"<b>Worldwide Institute for Archeological Development [WIAD]</b>: A seemingly cultural association, occuping itself with excavation of old and powerful Banes, researches regarding the Claws of the Wyrm and lost caerns who than they defile.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>====================================<br /> &quot;Worst English-language User&quot; 2011-2015, 2017 running for the 2018<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ed6RV6Z.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div></div> </div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/515-ryoga84","name":"Ryoga84","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar515_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T15:58:36-07:00","id":176470,"title":"","content":"I have to say, I never expected something I made up while half asleep in response to an &quot;unofficial challenge&quot; would really get much attention. I'm glad people like the AquaTek idea though! When I started writing it I didn't have much of a direction, I was just thinking &quot;Evil Sea World&quot; and it just kinda went from there. I had a lot of fun with it in the end though and I'm glad to see others approve of it.<br /> <br /> You are all, of course, welcome to use it in your games if you wish. Not that I could stop you anyway <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> . I intentionally left a lot of it open so it can be expanded upon as need be. Enjoy!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>We'll ride the Spiral to the end, we may just go where no one's been...<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img19/986/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img546/6111/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3188-vermiis","name":"Vermiis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T21:25:02-07:00","id":176711,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Laughing Hyena</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/171587-pentex-subsidiaries?p=176006#post176006\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now that I think about it, what about a corrupt charity organization for GLS (Genetic Lycanthope Syndrome)? Of which, none of the money even goes to DNA?<br /> <br /> *Cough*, *Cough* <a href=\"http://goldenheartedrose.tumblr.com/post/89338501188/autism-speaks-masterpost-new-updated-6-20-14\" target=\"_blank\">That's even way worse than a real world counterpart</a>?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I love the idea of an &quot;Autism Speaks&quot; satire using &quot;curing lycanthropy&quot; - the only problem jumping out at me is that it involves &quot;GLS&quot; being public knowledge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T23:21:24-07:00","id":176777,"title":"","content":"Ok, in the previous BotW tradition of the &quot;Top 21&quot; - here's the &quot;Top 31&quot; (including notable sub-subsidiaries) for my own table.<br /> <br /> Ardus Enterprises<br /> Autumn Health Management Systems<br /> Avalon, Incorporated<br /> Blackfire Security<br /> Cash n'Run <i>(pay day lender chain)</i><br /> Circinus Brands<br /> Consolidex Worldwide<br /> CSS Health &amp; Education<br /> Endron International<br /> Eterent Company<br /> GEO Dreams<br /> Good House International<br /> Hallahan Fishing Company [AquaTek Adventure - though that connection is NOT blatantly broadcast]<br /> Harold &amp; Harold Mining<br /> Hendrick's <i>(expanded now into a full town-eating Big Box chain)</i><br /> Herculean Firearms<br /> Homogeneity House<i> (not really a subsidiary, actually a separate non-profit, but the King and Hallahan families are their biggest homophobic contributors)</i><br /> King's Breweries &amp; Distilleries<br /> Magadon Pharmaceutical [Aesop Research - does shadier offsite experimentation] [Siren Cosmetics]<br /> Morning Wing Jets <i>(notoriously discrete charter airline)</i><br /> Nastrum Enterprises<br /> O'Tooley's<br /> Oran-Cocolive<br /> Rainbow Chemical <i>(expanded beyond plastics into many industrial chemical productions)</i><br /> Slaughterhouse Video<br /> Sunburst Electronics<br /> Tellus Enterprises [Black Dog Game Factory - which in turn licenses out to the Black Road]<br /> TruCall Holdings [OmniTV] [OmniKids] [RED Network] [RED Sports] [RED Weather] [RBCN] <i>(that's RED Business and Consumer News) </i>[Atlas Planet] <i>(supposedly education network with lots of racist alien conspiracy theories) </i>[Private Playground]<br /> Tyche Fortune &amp; Entertainment, Ltd.<br /> Vesuvius Publishing<br /> Young &amp; Smith, Incorporated [Feed-and-Read]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T02:08:08-07:00","id":176865,"title":"","content":"Actually on further thought, I'll push Slaughterhouse Video under the Private Playground umbrella (which is in turn under the TruCall Holdings umbrella), Oran-Cocolive under the Young &amp; Smith umbrella, and Homogeneity House under Hallahan and King's as its a separate &quot;charity&quot; they fund, rather than legally Pentex property.<br /> <br /> Which gives me 3 more slots to count up to &quot;the Big 31&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T02:45:37-07:00","id":176882,"title":"","content":"I just realized they don't have a damn apparel company! Ala class tiered labels (with all the Abrecombe &amp; Fitch bigotry at the top), selling sex for children's brands, a Nike-style sports subsidiary, and of course SWEATSHOPS SWEATSHOPS SWEATSHOPS!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T04:00:23-07:00","id":176900,"title":"","content":"Clark &amp; Cochran is a law firm I've been working on since if there is one thing that could connect all of the various subsidiaries of Pentex who don't even know they all work for the same big corporation it would be a very talented law firm. A very talented law firm just waiting to have a legal clerk start to put things together, or have a group of Garou uncover something much bigger than they went looking for, or even just a group of lawyers unknowing having their strings pulled by one particular enemy of the Wyrm known as the Weaver.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3197-david-michael-felt","name":"David Michael Felt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3197_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T15:00:52-07:00","id":177372,"title":"","content":"I am still waiting for &quot;Pequad&quot; to sell over priced mediocre coffee and other beverages on every street corner across america.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3319-wanderingmystic","name":"WanderingMystic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-04T21:12:57-07:00","id":188477,"title":"","content":"So while we aren't getting their write-ups in the Pentex Employee Handbook, I'm really curious about the other subsidiaries and I'm wondering whether any writers are free to comment on them?<br /> <br /> Was Herrick's getting the upgrade from &quot;grocery chain&quot; to &quot;Big-Box Store&quot;?<br /> <br /> Consolidex is both an investment firm and a payday lender? That's a bit... odd. Is the pay day lending chain at least under a different name - because otherwise that would seem likely to discourage the stock clients.<br /> <br /> So North Wing... we've never heard of this one before. Airline? Commercial or charter?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-05T18:38:53-07:00","id":189036,"title":"","content":"Ok, how many of us actually use these corporations in our games? in close to seven years of games I think I've run a game involving DNA like one time.<br /> <br /> I've run some encounters with the Society of Leopold, but most of my games have involved things like corrupt cops, vampires, and gang violence when dealing with the Wyrm and a hell of a lot of inter Sept politicking. <br /> <br /> So, how many of you actually run Garou v. Corporation games? How do you do it? How do you set it up and how do you play it out?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2646-last-man-standing","name":"Last-Man-Standing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2646_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-05T20:23:14-07:00","id":189133,"title":"","content":"I have used Harold and Harold Mining (with fomori and BSD &quot;security&quot;) as villains in an Ahadi game, running a brutal blood diamond cartel. While Rokea vs. Garou ended up being the a-plot, Hallahan Fishing and Endron oil rigs played a role in another game. I'd like to do a game with Consolidex/pay-day lender/tyche (my own aforementioned online gambling company) obtaining the souls of people super in debt to turn them into fomori.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-06T08:57:13-07:00","id":189459,"title":"","content":"Ok, I can see how a mining camp ravaging countryside and exploiting the locals would make a great bad guy, but I guess I don't understand how to make it play out on a bigger scale. Let's say you destroy the camp and turn it in to rubble, but what happens next? There's still a multi-billion diamond syndicate behind that corporation. Do they hire hunters and extra security? Do they use political leverage to get the corrupt third world country to roll battalion of T-72s over the Sept? They could start a war with any ethnic factions in the area to try and get a full on genocide going. <br /> <br /> You can take out a facility or a camp or a factory, but how do you fight a corporation? How do you fight decades of marketing the marketing convincing people that they need a product? How do you stop the lobbying?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2646-last-man-standing","name":"Last-Man-Standing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2646_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-06T13:58:45-07:00","id":189621,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Last-Man-Standing</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/171587-pentex-subsidiaries?p=189459#post189459\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok, I can see how a mining camp ravaging countryside and exploiting the locals would make a great bad guy, but I guess I don't understand how to make it play out on a bigger scale. Let's say you destroy the camp and turn it in to rubble, but what happens next? There's still a multi-billion diamond syndicate behind that corporation. Do they hire hunters and extra security? Do they use political leverage to get the corrupt third world country to roll battalion of T-72s over the Sept? They could start a war with any ethnic factions in the area to try and get a full on genocide going.<br /> <br /> You can take out a facility or a camp or a factory, but how do you fight a corporation? How do you fight decades of marketing the marketing convincing people that they need a product? How do you stop the lobbying?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Exactly? You're hitting the exact thematic point of using Pentex in a game.<br /> <br /> In that particular game the characters had to work to unify disparate ethnic groups against their corporate colonizers to make dealing with the warlord slave masters more costly than the diamonds, while Glass Walker one of the PCs recruited raided the De Beers to unleash enough diamonds on the market to deflate the value.<br /> <br /> They still had to deal with immediate resurgent violence as soon as Harold &amp; Harold was gone though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T18:56:20-07:00","id":945807,"title":"","content":"Sorry for the necro(I've kicked myself) but I figured I'd put this question here:<br /> <br /> Which Pentex subsidiary would be primarily in charge of space exploration/contact with aliens, etc.?<br /> <br /> I know Technocracy fits the bill perfectly, but is there something Pentex-related that could also work?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T19:08:51-07:00","id":945815,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fat Larry</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/171587-pentex-subsidiaries?p=945807#post945807\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry for the necro(I've kicked myself) but I figured I'd put this question here:<br /> <br /> Which Pentex subsidiary would be primarily in charge of space exploration/contact with aliens, etc.?<br /> <br /> I know Technocracy fits the bill perfectly, but is there something Pentex-related that could also work?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nastrum Enterprises. It already specializes in rocketry and aircraft because it's in the WMD market. It'd be just a short hop over in production, compared to other subsidiaries, to making aerospace vehicles.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T19:18:31-07:00","id":945824,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/171587-pentex-subsidiaries?p=945815#post945815\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nastrum Enterprises. It already specializes in rocketry and aircraft because it's in the WMD market. It'd be just a short hop over in production, compared to other subsidiaries, to making aerospace vehicles.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thank you very much!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T20:47:52-07:00","id":945903,"title":"","content":"Does Pentax have a candy company, because I have heard stories about the chocolate industry that almost seem to over the top for the wod. I would personally include a family running the company that is a parody of the legendarily screwed up Mars (the ones that own M&amp;Ms) family and have them be in a feud with the King family over who the most fucked up Pentax family is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T20:53:15-07:00","id":945905,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/171587-pentex-subsidiaries?p=945903#post945903\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does Pentax have a candy company, because I have heard stories about the chocolate industry that almost seem to over the top for the wod. I would personally include a family running the company that is a parody of the legendarily screwed up Mars (the ones that own M&amp;Ms) family and have them be in a feud with the King family over who the most fucked up Pentax family is.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That does need to happen....if they don't already, any thoughts on the name? Personally I'm partial to Venus Choclatiers (to keep up that Mars theme).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T21:04:27-07:00","id":945915,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CeltSPZ</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/171587-pentex-subsidiaries?p=945905#post945905\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> That does need to happen....if they don't already, any thoughts on the name? Personally I'm partial to Venus Choclatiers (to keep up that Mars theme).</div> </div> </div> </div>II would call them Galaxy Choclatiers since they also own the milky way bar (and their Dove chocolate bars are sold under the name galaxy in many countries). MArs owns starburst and orbit too, so space is a bit of a theme with them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":3932,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","user":"The young man in the cafe","date":". 08-08-2016, 12:07 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T21:10:37-07:00","id":945924,"title":"","content":"and here I was just going for basic Roman Gods (and well the whole guys give gals chocolate for dates/anniversary/valentines!)<br /> <br /> Mind you I don't know a ton about what Mars has been up to, bu