ote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/171587-pentex-subsidiaries?p=949797#post949797\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">yes but was saying if Westboro (or some parody of them) was allied with pentex it would probaly be occasional funding supplies, maybe some free legal help done through multiple channels.</div> </div> </div> </div>You might actually want to do some research into westboro's methods. It's less of a hate group as much as its a legal scam.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-13T07:41:49-07:00","id":950029,"title":"","content":"when its website is &quot;Godhatesfags.com&quot; Id call it a hate group","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-13T08:08:28-07:00","id":950036,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/171587-pentex-subsidiaries?p=950029#post950029\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">when its website is &quot;Godhatesfags.com&quot; Id call it a hate group</div> </div> </div> </div>Fine, since you're going to be lazy about it and it's not in a white wolf book I'll break it down for you. <br /> <br /> A lot of what they do is passive aggressive behavior. They don't hold rallies, they &quot;protest&quot; events. They don't seek to change the discussion or overturn any laws like the clan did back in the day. <br /> <br /> They run a scam, its would be the same as me attending a MS conference and carrying a sign that reads &quot;Should have been throw off a cliff!&quot; With some 300 artwork pasted on. Now I don't personally believe that but to someone attending the conference I'm worse then Hitler and wouldn't mind punching me in the face. In which case the insidious practices of wbc take effect.<br /> <br /> Now here is their secret, the heads of the wbc are lawyer's, so was the old man and I'm pretty sure everyone else is a hire posing as &quot;extended family&quot;. Here is how they operate, they go in and &quot;protest&quot; now if anyone should happen to harm or mess them in anyway they sue the pants off of that person, the local authorities and the city where they are at. It's all a money making scheme. It's the same as someone intentionally slipping on a freshly mopped floor because the janitor didn't put out the wet floor sign. <br /> <br /> So while yes they have a message of hate, it's more of a means to an ends with them. As they say in Texas they are &quot;All hat no cattle.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3953,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","user":"Dwight","date":". 08-13-2016, 11:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-13T09:10:54-07:00","id":950074,"title":"","content":"Oh thank you!<br /> <br /> That does make sense, a disgusting perverted sense.<br /> <br /> My sister said if she had seen them disrupting the funeral of one of her friends- oh wait some background<br /> <br /> (She graduated college (Unlike me) with $60,000 in student loans to pay off in spite of working part time and constantly asking mom and dad for money)<br /> <br /> So she joined the army in exchange for them taking responsiblety for her debts<br /> <br /> But she said if she saw someone disrupting the funerals of her friends she would have killed them<br /> <br /> in spite of wanting to expatriate before my MS diagnosis, I found them extremely tasteless<br /> <br /> not sure why I care as I have no love for the US of A anymore but still care for the people within it.<br /> <br /> <br /> Their were similar cases with MediaDefender before the hack that shut it down they were accused of being a business whos whole build was generating revenue via lawsuits.<br /> <br /> People argued that if your sole source of income is generating lawsuits to prosecute, then your not bringing them to court in good faith,but MediaDefender had people from the FBI acting as their henchmen, when according to many authoritys, MediaDefenders Lawsuits should be summarily dismissed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 08-13-2016, 03:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-13T09:12:52-07:00","id":950076,"title":"","content":"When were you diagnosed with multiple sclerosis?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link"