ot;. And yes - they make Zombie Fomori.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-19T14:38:01-08:00","id":1177421,"title":"","content":"If asked to come up with a PENTEX affiliated music label, I'd be sorely tempted to go with one where a lot of the signed artists have this habit of dying young in some fashion - ODs, suicides, plane crash, murder by stalker, etc. - which turns them into instant posthumous icons who will continue to pump out new albums of live, &quot;lost&quot;, and other unreleased material for years to come.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-19T16:42:42-08:00","id":1177451,"title":"","content":"Personally I worry about going too \u201cSeduction of the Innocent\u201d and puritanical 80s lyrics panic with a music label. Not that music labels don\u2019t do evil things - but generally at the expense of artists, not corrupting the audience.<br /> <br /> Of course I have similar issues with several Pentex subsidiaries. Magadon for example i\u2019m happy to portray using med research as cover for fomori experimentation, and promoting opioid addiction, but I\u2019m uncomfortable with stuff that hewes too close to anti-vax and anti-psychiatry conspiracy theories.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-19T21:17:57-08:00","id":1177513,"title":"","content":"Ok, it's been a while, but here's my list of what the true believer Wyrm Cultists in upper management of Pentex refer to as &quot;the Sacred 23&quot;. If some of these are overly political, it's because the game's themes are inherently political...<br /> <br /> <br /> 1) <b>Endron International </b>(oil and gas)<br /> <b>2) Magadon Incorporated </b>(pharmaceuticals and med-tech, their meds are legit, I have little interest in anti-vaxx or anti-psych conspiracy theories at my table; but they are directly entwined with opioid addiction epidemics, and use medical research as a cover for the breeding of new diverse designer fomori)<br /> <b>3) Sunburst Computers </b>(also owns <b>Tellus Enterprises, </b>which owns <b>Black Dog Game Factory</b> in turn. Drop the whole &quot;Incognito&quot; thing - and instead replace it with more of a Gamergate-expy since it\u2019s closer aligned with protecting industry norms)<br /> <b>4) OmniBroadcasting</b> (telecommunications conglomerate ala Comcast, with all the oligopolistic abuses; owns OmniTV, OmniKids, <b>RedNetwork</b>, <b>Extreme Wrestling Warfare, </b>and covertly <b>Private Playground </b>[Double-P is a porn producer and provider ala MindGeek])<br /> <b>5) Harold &amp; Harold Mining </b>(independent from Endron, mostly involved in rare metals mining in Africa, with a horrific legacy of worker enslavement and mutilation)<br /> <b>6) Hallahan Fishing Company</b> (in addition to overfishing and brutal whaling, Hallahan also breed mutant [fomori &amp; Mockeries] horrors in penned farming, and is the money behind <b>AquaTek Adventure \u2013 </b>the SeaWorld expy created by \u201cMike\u201d in his Pentex board pitch)<br /> <b>7) Consolidex Worldwide</b> (a predatory loan agency, including pay day loan storefronts, also through off shore shell companies owns <b>Tyche Entertainment Ltd. </b>an online gambling company officially hqed in the Carribbean. Habitual debtors are eventually forced to use their souls as collatoral, creating fomori)<br /> <b>8) Eterent Incorporated</b> (Agribusiness behind the Wyrm-tainted corn syrup used in most Young &amp; Smith products, mass methane producing cattle ranching supplanting the Amazon, including breeding Apis-Mockeries; the most famous imperialist horrors of fruit companies in the colonized world were before Pentex moved in on the scene, but Eterent is eagerly picking up that legacy via copyrighting plant dna to ingrain themselves in those colonizing companies)<br /> <b>9) Good House International</b> (doing the deforstation work in the Amazon to make room for Eterent\u2019s ranches)<br /> <b>10) O'Tooley's </b>(McDonald\u2019s)<br /> <b>11) Circinus Brands</b> (cigarette 