ohol the company itself produces, the King family bankrolls such right-wing causes as <b>Restoration House</b>, who seeks to \u201cheal\u201d LGBT youths, producings self-hating fomori in the process)<br /> <b>19) Ardus Enterprises</b> (waste management, actually just corrupt and sloppy, but propped up in those practices by their other Pentex clients with Cultist management)<br /> <b>20) Vesuvius Publishing </b>(magazines, comics, sensationalist current events books, wyrm spiritualism disguised as self-help books, etc)<br /> <b>21) Montaigne Services Group</b> (SCI based funerary services and cemetery company with countless storefronts masquerading as locally owned, systematically bilking the grieving, tainting earth and workers alike with embalming chemicals, and creating zombie fomori)<br /> <b>22) Zelus, Inc.</b> (apparel company with the most horrific sweatshops through the developing world [competing with Sunburst\u2019s of course])<br /> <b>23) Autumn Health Management</b> (private hospitals and retirement homes, growing in prominence among the 23 with ageing baby-boomers)<br /> <br /> <br /> Of course these aren\u2019t the only corporations that have come and go from Pentex\u2019s umbrella, just the current reigning ones. Others include\u2026<br /> <br /> - <b>Perses Energy</b> (nuclear power [Atlas in canon, but I changed the name], has declined as a major player. It\u2019s facilities do substantially less damage than fossil fuel plants under normal operations, but are rigged as bombs as a doomsday threat scenario for the Pentex Board)<br /> - <b>Biestford, Mangeur, and Entweihen </b>(corporate law firm that more plays defense for the rest of the family rather than doing direct damage on its own part)<br /> - <b>Horizon Education</b> (a new rising private test publishing company bankrolling education \u201creform\u201d efforts draining the souls of students and teachers, and also backing for-profit unaccredited higher education scams to create more debt for 